OL,3,GNEWSAFive more arrests in wrong-way
OL,4,Acrash investigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive more people have been arrested in
OL,7,Fan investigation into a wrong-way crash
OL,8,Fon the A66 in Middlesbrough which
OL,9,Fkilled seven people, including two
OL,10,Fpolice officers.
OL,12,FCleveland Police said a 16-year-old
OL,13,Fboy, 18-year-old man and 21-year-old
OL,14,Fman were arrested on suspicion of
OL,15,Fparticipating in an organised crime
OL,16,Fgroup. A 55-year-old man was also
OL,17,Farrested on suspicion of assisting an
OL,18,Foffender and a 23-year-old man on
OL,19,Fsuspicion of making threats to kill.
OL,21,FTwelve arrests had already been made,
OL,22,Fbringing the new total to 17.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
